 $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum2412 (k215PVector u t w c a b 0 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum2438 (k215PVector u a (t, w) c a b 0 0 v)) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage0At2412) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage1At2412) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage2At2412) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage3At2412) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage4At2412) k215PushAStage5At2412)))));

